WEBVTT

00:00:02.203 --> 00:00:03.149
3 CHASERS, 2 BEATERS,

00:00:03.192 --> 00:00:04.890
ONE KEEPER,
AND A SEEKER.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.631
THAT'S YOU.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.376
THERE ARE
3 KINDS OF BALLS.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.162
THIS ONE'S CALLED
THE "QUAFFLE."

00:00:16.205 --> 00:00:18.425
NOW, THE CHASERS
HANDLE THE QUAFFLE

00:00:18.469 --> 00:00:20.035
AND TRY TO PUT IT

00:00:20.079 --> 00:00:21.820
THROUGH ONE
OF THOSE 3 HOOPS.

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:24.518
THE KEEPER--
THAT'S ME--

00:00:24.562 --> 00:00:25.693
DEFENDS THE HOOPS.

00:00:25.737 --> 00:00:26.912
WITH ME SO FAR?

00:00:26.955 --> 00:00:28.957
I THINK SO.

00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:30.481
WHAT ARE THOSE?

00:00:33.135 --> 00:00:35.137
YOU BETTER TAKE THIS.

00:00:39.054 --> 00:00:40.795
[SQUEALING]

00:00:46.061 --> 00:00:47.846
CAREFUL NOW.
IT'S COMING BACK.

00:00:53.591 --> 00:00:55.593
OH...

00:00:55.636 --> 00:00:57.638
NOT BAD, POTTER.

00:00:57.682 --> 00:00:59.292
YOU'D MAKE
A FAIR BEATER.

00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:02.164
UH-OH.

00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:03.426
OOF!

00:01:04.427 --> 00:01:06.386
[SQUEALING]

00:01:06.429 --> 00:01:07.822
[GRUNTING]

00:01:15.438 --> 00:01:16.962
WHAT WAS THAT?

00:01:18.833 --> 00:01:20.661
A BLUDGER.

00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:22.576
NASTY LITTLE BUGGERS.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:25.579
BUT YOU...ARE A SEEKER.

00:01:29.365 --> 00:01:30.976
THE ONLY THING

00:01:31.019 --> 00:01:32.717
I WANT YOU
TO WORRY ABOUT

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:34.022
IS THIS...

00:01:34.066 --> 00:01:37.330
THE "GOLDEN SNITCH."

00:01:37.373 --> 00:01:38.853
I LIKE THIS BALL.

00:01:38.897 --> 00:01:40.812
AH, YOU LIKE IT NOW.

00:01:40.855 --> 00:01:42.161
JUST WAIT.

00:01:42.204 --> 00:01:43.249
IT'S WICKED FAST

00:01:43.292 --> 00:01:45.207
AND DAMN NEAR
IMPOSSIBLE TO SEE.

00:01:45.251 --> 00:01:46.992
WHAT DO I DO WITH IT?

00:01:47.035 --> 00:01:48.515
YOU CATCH IT...

00:01:48.559 --> 00:01:50.604
BEFORE THE OTHER
TEAM'S SEEKER.

00:01:50.648 --> 00:01:52.432
YOU CATCH THIS,
THE GAME'S OVER.

00:01:52.475 --> 00:01:57.219
YOU CATCH THIS,
POTTER, AND WE WIN.

00:01:58.525 --> 00:02:00.527
[WHIRRING]

00:02:03.312 --> 00:02:04.618
WHOA.

00:02:06.402 --> 00:02:09.405
ONE OF A WIZARD'S
MOST RUDIMENTARY SKILLS

00:02:09.449 --> 00:02:11.320
IS LEVITATION...

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:15.324
OR THE ABILITY
TO MAKE OBJECTS FLY.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.413
UH, DO YOU ALL HAVE
YOUR FEATHERS?

00:02:17.457 --> 00:02:18.458
GOOD.

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:19.851
NOW, UH,

00:02:19.894 --> 00:02:21.853
DON'T FORGET
THE NICE WRIST MOVEMENT

00:02:21.896 --> 00:02:23.768
WE'VE BEEN PRACTICING, HMM?

00:02:23.811 --> 00:02:26.292
THE SWISH AND FLICK.

00:02:26.335 --> 00:02:27.423
EVERYONE.

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:30.992
All: THE SWISH AND FLICK.

00:02:31.036 --> 00:02:33.604
GOOD. OH, AND ENUNCIATE.

00:02:33.647 --> 00:02:36.607
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:38.565
OFF YOU GO, THEN.

00:02:39.697 --> 00:02:42.090
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

00:02:42.134 --> 00:02:44.658
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

00:02:44.702 --> 00:02:47.487
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSAR.

00:02:48.662 --> 00:02:50.621
NO, STOP,
STOP, STOP.

00:02:50.664 --> 00:02:52.927
YOU'RE GOING TO TAKE
SOMEONE'S EYE OUT.

00:02:52.971 --> 00:02:55.060
BESIDES, YOU'RE
SAYING IT WRONG.

00:02:55.103 --> 00:02:57.279
IT'S LEVI-OSA...

00:02:57.323 --> 00:02:58.933
NOT LEVIO-SAR.

00:02:58.977 --> 00:03:01.414
YOU DO IT, THEN,
IF YOU'RE SO CLEVER.

00:03:01.457 --> 00:03:02.937
GO ON. GO ON.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.985
WINGARDIUM LEVIOSA.

00:03:15.558 --> 00:03:17.212
OH, WELL DONE!

00:03:17.256 --> 00:03:19.084
SEE HERE, EVERYONE.

00:03:19.127 --> 00:03:20.738
MISS GRANGER'S DONE IT!

00:03:20.781 --> 00:03:22.696
OH, SPLENDID!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.480
WINGARD LEVIOSA.

00:03:24.524 --> 00:03:25.612
WELL DONE, DEAR.

00:03:25.656 --> 00:03:26.874
[BOOM]

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.311
OOH...

00:03:31.313 --> 00:03:32.837
I THINK WE'RE GOING
TO NEED ANOTHER FEATHER

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.360
OVER HERE, PROFESSOR.

00:03:41.802 --> 00:03:46.111
"IT'S LEVI-OSA,
NOT LEVIO-SAR."

00:03:46.154 --> 00:03:48.417
SHE'S A NIGHTMARE,
HONESTLY.

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:50.681
NO WONDER SHE HASN'T
GOT ANY FRIENDS.

00:03:52.073 --> 00:03:53.988
I THINK
SHE HEARD YOU.

00:03:57.383 --> 00:03:59.385
[THUNDER]

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.882
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]

00:04:23.148 --> 00:04:24.298
WHERE'S HERMIONE?
